>/tmp, /var/tmp, and primary swap on the 2GB mirrored volume with UFS.
>
>I'd like to use AdvFS for the file systems (/home, /pub, /local, etc.)
>on the RAID 5 volume.
>
>What do people recommend for this config? Making the /dev/re1g partition
>an LSM volume and then putting one Advfs domain on it? Breaking the
