can afford to throw  150 GBP (probably similar USD price) at the
problem then I'd strongly reccomend getting an RRD45 or RRD46 drive,
otherwise you'll need to talk to DEC about getting firmware upgrades
or kernel patches from their woefully innadequate public ftp server.



